@base = http://localhost:8000

### API status
GET {{base}}/

### Categories
GET {{base}}/categories

### Books
GET {{base}}/books

### Create a book
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A new book",
  "author": "Example Author",
  "description": "A short description.",
  "price": 14.99,
  "rating": 4.5,
  "category_id": 1
}

### Users
GET {{base}}/users

### Orders
GET {{base}}/orders

### Create an order with its items
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "book_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard

### Search Open Library
GET {{base}}/external/books?q=The%20Little%20Prince

### OpenAPI document
GET {{base}}/public/v1/docs/swagger.php
